      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "Over the past few months, Anthropic scientists have engaged in deep research partnerships with six organizations developing new medicines. We've also begun drug discovery efforts of our own.\n\nIn doing so, we’ve learned much more about how Claude can support the many stages of drug development.\n\nIn this blog post, we share some early results from these efforts, and describe how this work fits in with our wider ambitions in the life sciences.\n\nhttps://www.anthropic.com/research/early-progress-drug-development",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": {
        "author": "AnthropicAI",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1798110641414443008/XP8gyBaY_200x200.jpg",
