      "text": "Elon Musk: \"We should really look at anyone who permanently castr*tes a kid as right up there with Josef Mengele. They're mutil*ting children.\"\n\nJoe Rogan: \"And it's thought of as being kind. Would you rather have a live daughter or a dead son?\"\n\nMusk: \"That's the line they use… In fact, the probability of su*cide increases if you trans a kid. Not decreases. By some accounts, it triples. So, that is an evil lie.\" https://x.com/ElonClipsX/status/2034878727574724768/video/1",
